          "paramID": "safety_tolerance",
          "flagID": "safety-tolerance",
          "maxValue": 4,
          "minValue": 0
        },
        {
          "paramID": "keyframes",
          "flagID": "input-media",
          "maxMultiple": 10,
          "modelInfoComment": "Flux.3 Video special usage: <[keyframe:]media-file>. For each media input to appear a number of seconds into the clip, use an optional keyframe value in seconds (e.g., Specify '3:image.png' for the image to appear 3 seconds into the clip.) Images are keyframes: a numeric time can be set on any image and requires --duration. Alternatively, supply one untimed video to continue it; images and a video cannot be combined. See online docs for details on keyframe usage and supporting models: https://bildomat.com/docs."
        }
      ]
    },
